### This project ###
# Local mod jars (Create Big Cannons, Ritchie's Projectile Library, ...).
# They are copied from a real game install and must never be committed.
libs/

# Documentation, migration logs, analysis reports and plans.
# Kept out of version control on purpose — see docs/README.md.
docs/

# Architectury leftovers from the 1.20.1 tree (harmless if absent).
.architectury-transformer/

# Scratch space used while reverse-engineering the reference jar and the
# dependency jars (javap / unzip dumps). Never part of the build.
.tmp/

